type (#raw(lang:"verbatim", "DG_TYPE") property,
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "type") metadata or a file tag), a relation can
list the types it should connect, and the browser graph flags other
edges with a warning sign. Boxes without a coloured tag take the colour
of their type, and an attribute such as #raw(lang:"verbatim", "[2]") is
shown after the title.
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "relationship-annotator-review") lists anomalies,
claims with gaps and the strength of each answer. The old variable and
command names stay as obsolete aliases, so
