configuration and stops on self-references. The SQLite cache, the
websocket UI and node/link creation were not ported;
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "docs/relationship-annotator-vs-discourse-graphs.org")
compares the two and lists what was left out.

How: the discourse layer works on the tree that
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "--build") returns, with an index of edges
standing in for the SQL queries. The literate doc was regenerated and
tangles to the \.el and \.html byte for byte. Tested on mock notes in
