with another background, white borders stayed around the buffers.
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-windows") painted the window dividers, the
fringe and (indirectly) the frame border with the default background
#strong[once, when the module loaded], so they kept the colour of the
theme loaded at startup. Most themes (Doric included) also give
