graphic frame (a daemon that started without a frame has no background
to read yet). Values like #raw(lang:"verbatim", "unspecified-bg")
(terminal frames) are skipped.

#strong[Checked] (Emacs 29.3, no GUI available): with the default
background stubbed to two colours in turn, all five faces follow it.
