  (#raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-taskman-extra")).
- #strong[#raw(lang:"verbatim", "M-x sp-org-tag-add"):] inserts a tag
  above a marker line in the registry file, saves it and runs
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "load-file"), so it works without restarting. It
  asks first if the tag is close to a registered one (typo guard).
- #strong[#raw(lang:"verbatim", "M-x sp-org-tag-lint"):] scans the vault
  (vulpea db, else #raw(lang:"verbatim", "~/notes")) and reports
  unregistered tags in #raw(lang:"verbatim", "#+filetags:") and on
