  for the columns not listed) and #raw(lang:"verbatim", ":wrap")
  (#raw(lang:"verbatim", "wrap") or #raw(lang:"verbatim", "fit")).
  Views, the dynamic block and the menu carry them like any other key;
  vui and Org ignore them.
- #raw(lang:"verbatim", "wrap") keeps the widths and wraps long text
  onto more lines. #raw(lang:"verbatim", "fit") sizes each column to its
