Adds #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-author-notes")
(#raw(lang:"verbatim", "M-x sp-author-notes"),
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-author-notes-preview")), documented in
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "docs/tangles/funct/sp-author-notes.org").

What it does:

- Reads #raw(lang:"verbatim", "litnotes/") (file-level meta only) and
  fixes typos of #raw(lang:"verbatim", "pub-author")
  (#raw(lang:"verbatim", "pub-authro"),
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "Pub_Author")\; two edits away is only
  reported).
- Creates a #raw(lang:"verbatim", ":person:") note for each plain author
  name with no note, via #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org--write-note"),
  and turns the name into an #raw(lang:"verbatim", "[[id:...]]") link.
  (#raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org--create-note") does not exist; this is
  the function behind
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-create-note-and-link")\.)
