==== What
<what>
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-reading-mode") in
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-writedesk")
(#raw(lang:"verbatim", "C-c w r")): a buffer-local minor mode for
reading long prose in Org. From Rougier\'s book-mode and its article
example it keeps the margins (8 left, 6 right), the line spacing (1) and
the zero fringes; all are =defcustom=s.

- Turns #raw(lang:"verbatim", "olivetti-mode") off while active (both
  use window margins) and back on afterwards if it was on.
