  margin and fringe widths, #raw(lang:"verbatim", "word-wrap"),
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "truncate-lines"),
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "visual-line-mode") and
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "olivetti-mode") first; toggling off restores
  each.
- Margins are reapplied to every window on the buffer after window
  changes.

Only the ideas are used; the code is new (book-mode is GPL-3.0, nothing
copied). Left out: the header/mode-line, frame resizing and
#raw(lang:"verbatim", "message") override, and Rougier\'s margin bullets
and heading markers (listed as not done in the doc).

