  lists them.
- #strong[Registry from groups:]
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-tag-registry.el") now sets
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-tag-groups-alist") and
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-tag-groups-ungrouped") and derives
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "org-tag-persistent-alist") from them
  (#raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-tag-groups-to-alist"), Org\'s group-tag
  form). #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-tag-add") asks for the group and
  inserts the tag in that element.
  #raw(lang:"verbatim", "sp-org-tag-groups") no longer holds a copy of
  the data. Group names are registered tags and are in their own group.
- #strong[ADR 0020:] records both decisions and what was implemented,
  including that a member named like its group is left out of the Org
  form.
