  without a prefix argument (default nil, so nothing changes unless
  asked).
- The dry run still writes nothing. The report shows the proposed
  titles, marks values taken from BibTeX
  (#raw(lang:"verbatim", "from BibTeX: authors, year")), and lists notes
  whose citekey has no entry. #raw(lang:"verbatim", "convert") is
  unchanged otherwise (one confirmation, backups).

